o/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/DeltaSTwoRowCharacterVanishes.lean#L61-L69","doc":"For ANY two `2 × 2` matrices whose traces are `h`, the image of `Δ_S` is\ntraceless. Needs only `2 ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.deltaS","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.deltaS","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/DeltaSTwoRowCharacterVanishes.lean#L55-L57","doc":"The single-wrap element evaluated on a pair of generator images. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.bSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.bSq","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/DeltaSTwoRowCharacterVanishes.lean#L52-L53","doc":"The Hoefsmit coupling squared, `b² = (q⁴+q²+1)/(q²+1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.zD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.zD","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/DeltaSTwoRowCharacterVanishes.lean#L49-L50","doc":"The convention-D Markov parameter `z_D = q³/(q²+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.h","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.DeltaSTwoRow.h","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/DeltaSTwoRowCharacterVanishes.lean#L46-L47","doc":"`h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}